Now we move to the **car rental and transport companies themselves** — the businesses that register on KigaliFleet and use it to manage their operations.

The storefront is what their customers see. This specification covers the other side: what the company owner, manager and employees see, do, control, receive and expect from KigaliFleet.

The important distinction is that we are not designing just an admin dashboard. We are designing a complete **Fleet Business Operating System**.

