\## 28. Final product principle\
\
KigaliFleet should help a transport business operate more reliably and make better decisions.\
\
It should not become a collection of disconnected CRUD pages.\
\
Every module should connect to the others:\
\
\- A new booking affects vehicle availability.\
\- Vehicle assignment affects dispatch.\
\- Dispatch affects driver schedules.\
\- Pickup affects rental status.\
\- Return affects vehicle availability and inspection.\
\- Maintenance affects future bookings.\
\- Payments affect outstanding balances.\
\- Expenses affect business performance.\
\- Storefront settings affect what customers see.\
\- Customer communication reflects the real booking status.\
\
The platform's value comes from these connections, not from the number of menu items.\

